{"id":"bf19f2410ce0d03b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-proof-length.md","title":"GL Proof Length","display":"df-gl-proof-length — GL Proof Length","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-proof-length","aliases":["89-df-gl-proof-length"],"display":"df-gl-proof-length — GL Proof Length","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-proof]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-proof-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-proof-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-proof-length — GL Proof Length"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7c243c33802ce69\" href=\"?note=c7c243c33802ce69\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof\">89-df-gl-proof</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{G\\!L}(A)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{G\\!L}(A)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7c243c33802ce69\" href=\"?note=c7c243c33802ce69\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof\">89-df-gl-proof</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下述定义的有限证明列行数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prf}\">\\(\\mathrm{prf}\\)</span> 为证明对象的角色下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}length}\\vdash\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{dom}(\\pi)|,\n\\qquad\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)=|\\pi|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}length}\\vdash\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{dom}(\\pi)|,\n\\qquad\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)=|\\pi|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\">\\(\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\)</span> 是证明序列中的公式行数，不等同于\n非公理规则应用次数。</li>\n<li>该记号与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a> 中作用于 Gödel 编码的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\)</span> 区分开。</li>\n<li>GL证明长度用于分析证明复杂度</li>\n<li>GL证明长度是模态逻辑的基本参数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c7c243c33802ce69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c7c243c33802ce69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{G\\!L}(A)$ (see [[89-df-gl-proof]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该记号与 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 中作用于 Gödel 编码的\n$\\mathrm{Len}(y)$ 区分开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{G\\!L}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}length}\\vdash\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{dom}(\\pi)|,\n\\qquad\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{prf}}(\\pi)=|\\pi|.","d